    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Nokia was in every pocket. So why did Microsoft pay billions for it?",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.19,
        "window": 3.8,
        "fill": 0.839
      },
      {
        "scene": "price",
        "text": "And Microsoft didn't buy it cheap. It paid €5.44B for the phones and the patents.",
        "start": 4.1,
        "seconds": 4.91,
        "window": 5.57,
        "fill": 0.882
      },
      {
        "scene": "split",
        "text": "€3.79B bought the phone business itself. The other €1.65B paid to use Nokia's patents. So what were those phones really worth?",
        "start": 9.67,
        "seconds": 8.15,
        "window": 8.77,
        "fill": 0.929
      },
      {
        "scene": "staff",
        "text": "About 32,000 Nokia staff were set to move over with it, from a company born in Finland.",
        "start": 18.43,
        "seconds": 4.04,
        "window": 4.7,
        "fill": 0.86
      },
      {
        "scene": "lumia",
        "text": "But Nokia's smartphones, the Lumias, ran Windows Phone. Not Android, and not the iPhone's system. So who would buy them?",
        "start": 23.13,
        "seconds": 5.38,
        "window": 6.03,
        "fill": 0.892
      },
      {
        "scene": "turn",
        "text": "Two summers later, Microsoft stopped trying to grow a phone business of its own. It cut 7,800 jobs, mostly in phones.",
        "start": 29.17,
        "seconds": 5.92,
        "window": 6.6,
        "fill": 0.897
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "Then it wrote $7.6B off its books, on the phone business it had bought just two years before.",
        "start": 35.77,
        "seconds": 4.76,
        "window": 5.4,
        "fill": 0.881
      },
      {
        "scene": "ending",
        "text": "Nokia or iPhone: which was your first phone? The one in your hand runs Android or Apple's system. Before them, it was this.",
        "start": 41.17,
        "seconds": 5.79,
        "window": 6.47,
        "fill": 0.895
      }
    ]
  },
